------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- p=2 F4/F2 FROBENIUS CANDIDATE: EXACT FINITE NEGATIVE CONTROL
--
-- SOURCE CALIBRATION
--
-- P2LaneInnerProductProof records:
--   * F4/F2,
--   * Gal(F4/F2) = C2 generated by Frobenius x |-> x^2,
--   * j=1728 / Gaussian-CM / conductor-level 4 context.
--
-- DASHI reconstructs only the four-point finite-field-shaped Frobenius carrier
-- needed for this negative control.  No source is credited with the Agda
-- action/groupoid theorem below.
--
-- Result:
--   whole F4 points under Frobenius have THREE orbits:
--
--     {0}, {1}, {alpha, alpha+1}.
--
-- Therefore the raw F4 point carrier cannot fully recognise the exact p=2
-- retained-orientation target, which has ten connected components.  A richer
-- marked level/CM cover is required.
------------------------------------------------------------------------

open import DASHI.Core.Prelude
